cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Erdos289: a Lean 4 development towards Erdős problem 289"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 / mathlib development of a universal graded affine-correction
  theorem and its descent towards Erdős problem 289.  The universal core, the
  five external inputs, the descent spine and the finite core stage are proved
  unconditionally and transitively axiom-audited; the unconditional final
  theorem is not claimed, and the remaining obligation appears as the single
  explicit hypothesis of a conditional theorem.
